>> servings: 4

Mince @garlic{6%clove}.

Add @olive oil{} and @garlic{} to pan and bring to low heat.

Add @anchovy{50%g} to pan.

Cook slowly until @anchovy{} starts to break down. Be careful not to burn or over-brown @garlic{}.

Cook @pasta{500%g} on the stove according to instructions.

Boil @broccoli{1%head} in salted water. Ensure not to overcook.

Finely chop @broccoli{} and add to pan and stir.

Take half a cup of pasta water and add to pan to thicken sauce.

Once pasta is cooked, fold in broccoli-anchovy sauce with grated @hard cheese{30%g}.

Add salt to taste.

Enjoy with @Banhoek chilli oil{} <3
